      "message": "The encoder performance results are given below. The CL is verified to be bit-exact for lowres2 test-set, speed\u003d0 and 3.\n\n```\n     \t\t Instruction Count                BD-Rate Loss(%)\ncpu   Resolution  Reduction(%)     avg.psnr   ovr.psnr   ssim     vmaf    vmaf_neg \n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n 1       LOWRES2     2.440          0.0218     0.0222   0.0063  -0.0457    0.0045  \n 1       MIDRES2     1.891          0.0021     0.0130   0.0295   0.0289    0.0248  \n 1    SHORTS608P     1.553         -0.0035     0.0048   0.0282   0.0686    0.0306  \n 1    SHORTS720P     1.303          0.0220     0.0322   0.0239   0.1114    0.0705  \n 1   SHORTS1080P     0.857          0.0316     0.0271   0.0153   0.0542    0.0543  \n 1        HDRES2     2.081          0.0828     0.0896   0.0553   0.1276    0.1298  \n 1       Average     1.647          0.0253     0.0305   0.0261   0.0594    0.0524  \n\n 2       LOWRES2     0.655         -0.0029    -0.0056  -0.0567  -0.0409    0.0387  \n 2       MIDRES2     1.550         -0.0386    -0.0402  -0.0303  -0.0999    0.0495  \n 2    SHORTS608P     1.320          0.0226     0.0238   0.0336   0.1227    0.0986  \n 2    SHORTS720P     0.984          0.0196     0.0129   0.0111   0.0850    0.0652  \n 2   SHORTS1080P     0.827          0.0167     0.0124  -0.0089  -0.0726   -0.0543  \n 2        HDRES2     1.589          0.0505     0.0406   0.0402   0.0422    0.0058  \n 2       Average     1.144          0.0121     0.0081  -0.0006   0.0096    0.0342  \n```         \n\n The instruction count reduction specified has been measured using command:\n \n``` \n $ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc\n``` \n\n Please review.",
